#: deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df:784
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df"
msgid "THE WHEEL spins... it stops at: "
msgstr "운명의 바퀴가 돈다... 멈춘 곳은: "

#: deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df:790
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df"
msgid "RUN FOR IT"
msgstr "도망쳐"

#: deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df:791
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df"
msgid " refuses to let "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df:791
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df"
msgid ""
" fate be decided by some weird wheel!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
" 운명을 이상한 바퀴 따위에 맡길 생각이 없다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df:792
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df"
msgid " decide"
msgstr "은(는)"

#: deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df:792
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df"
msgid " to run for it, but "
msgstr " 도망치기로 하지만, 탈출하면서 "

#: deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df:792
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df"
msgid " must ditch the car during the escape."
msgstr "은(는) 차를 버려야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df:799
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df"
msgid "Accept this fate"
msgstr "이 운명을 받아들인다"

#: deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df:800
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df"
msgid "Run away, but lose car!"
msgstr "도망친다, 하지만 차를 잃는다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df:804
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df"
msgid "FACE THE WHEEL... AGAIN"
msgstr "바퀴와 다시... 마주하라"

#: deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df:805
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df"
msgid ""
"Do-overs? How'd you know about our most sacred rule?\r\n"
"\tWell, fine, but you only get one!"
msgstr ""
"다시 하기? 우리의 가장 신성한 규칙을 어떻게 알았지?\r\n"
"\t뭐, 좋아. 하지만 딱 한 번뿐이야!"

#: deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df:811
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df"
msgid "FACE THE WHEEL"
msgstr "운명의 바퀴와 마주하라"

#: deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df:812
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df"
msgid ""
" stops at a small village. Rather than being a safe trading spot, things "
"quickly take a bad turn with the locals. As punishment, they bring out..."
msgstr "은(는) 작은 마을에 들른다. 안전한 거래 장소이긴커녕, 주민들과 금세 일이 틀어진다. 벌로 그들이 꺼내 온 것은..."

#: deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df:814
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/OMENTUM.df"
msgid "Demand do-overs!"
msgstr "다시 하기를 요구한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "GAME!!!"
msgstr "게임!!!"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:40
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "K.O!!!"
msgstr "K.O!!!"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "FATALITY!!!"
msgstr "페이탈리티!!!"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:42
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "MATCHPOINT!!!"
msgstr "매치 포인트!!!"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:43
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "RINGOUT!!!"
msgstr "링 아웃!!!"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "KNOCKOUT!!!"
msgstr "녹아웃!!!"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:45
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "TOUCHDOWN!!!"
msgstr "터치다운!!!"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "KILLSTREAK!!!"
msgstr "킬 스트릭!!!"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:47
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "RAMPAGE!!!"
msgstr "광란!!!"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:48
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "TALK ABOUT A HOLE IN ONE!!!"
msgstr "이거야말로 홀인원!!!"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "SCORE!!!"
msgstr "득점!!!"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:50
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "HOMERUN!!!"
msgstr "홈런!!!"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:217
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "POINTS: "
msgstr "점수: "

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:374
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "IT'S 12PM."
msgstr "정오다."

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:375
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "IT'S 12:00."
msgstr "12시다."

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:376
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "IT'S HIGH NOON."
msgstr "하이 눈이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:377
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "YEEHAW."
msgstr "이햐."

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:378
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "YA FEEL LOVELY, PUNK?"
msgstr "기분 좋냐, 애송이?"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:379
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "ROOTEM TOOTEM."
msgstr "루템 투템."

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:380
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "I'M A SHOOTIN COWBOY, NOT A SINGIN COWBOY."
msgstr "난 총 쏘는 카우보이지, 노래하는 카우보이가 아니야."

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:380
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "SOMEBODY'S POISONED THE WATERIN HOLE."
msgstr "누가 물웅덩이에 독을 탔군."

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:381
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "YIPPEE KI YAY."
msgstr "이피 카이 예이."

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:382
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "THERE'S A SNAKE IN MY BOOT."
msgstr "부츠 안에 뱀이 있어."

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:383
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "IT'S HIGH NOON?"
msgstr "하이 눈인가?"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:384
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "TOO SLOW ON THE DRAW."
msgstr "총 뽑는 게 너무 느려."

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:385
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "YEE HAW."
msgstr "이햐아."

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:386
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "HIGH NOON."
msgstr "하이 눈."

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:387
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "IT'S HIGH NOON..."
msgstr "하이 눈이다..."

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:388
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "IT'S HIIIIIGH NOON."
msgstr "하아아아이 눈이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:389
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "IT'S HONCHO NOON."
msgstr "혼초 눈이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:558
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid ""
" buys the Duckhunter(TM)!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 덕헌터(TM)를 산다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:559
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid ""
"- Shots will pierce and ricochet after they hit zombies!\r\n"
"\t- Reloads one shell at a time, when you're not shooting\r\n"
"\t- The last shell takes the longest to reload"
msgstr ""
"- 탄환이 좀비를 맞힌 뒤 관통하고 튕겨 나간다!\r\n"
"\t- 쏘지 않을 때 한 발씩 장전한다\r\n"
"\t- 마지막 탄 장전이 가장 오래 걸린다"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:566
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid ""
" buys the Lever-Action!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 레버액션을 산다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:567
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid ""
"- Tap ATTACK with the right timing to fire much faster!\r\n"
"\t- Keep an eye out on the indicators over your head\r\n"
"\t- When the indicator is no longer transparent, tap ATTACK"
msgstr ""
"- 타이밍 맞춰 공격 버튼을 누르면 훨씬 빨리 쏜다!\r\n"
"\t- 머리 위 표시를 잘 봐라\r\n"
"\t- 표시가 더 이상 투명하지 않을 때 공격 버튼을 눌러라"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:574
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid ""
" buys a Dolt Big Iron!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 돌트 빅 아이언을 산다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:575
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid ""
"- Hold ATTACK down to fire fast!\r\n"
"\t- Shoots much slower if you only tap ATTACK\r\n"
"\t- Has a reload period every 6 shots\r\n"
"\t- You must fire all 6 shots to reload"
msgstr ""
"- 공격 버튼을 누르고 있으면 빠르게 쏜다!\r\n"
"\t- 공격 버튼을 톡톡 누르기만 하면 훨씬 느리게 쏜다\r\n"
"\t- 6발마다 장전 시간이 있다\r\n"
"\t- 장전하려면 6발을 다 쏴야 한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:583
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid ""
" buys a Kukri.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 쿠크리를 산다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:584
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid ""
"- Single target\r\n"
"\t- Low cooldown \r\n"
"\t- Maims the target, slowing them \r\n"
"\t- OK damage"
msgstr ""
"- 단일 대상\r\n"
"\t- 짧은 재사용 대기시간 \r\n"
"\t- 대상을 불구로 만들어 느리게 한다 \r\n"
"\t- 피해는 그럭저럭"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:592
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid ""
" buys a trumpet with a flag.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 깃발 달린 트럼펫을 산다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:593
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid ""
"- Empowers teammates whilst held \r\n"
"\t- Comes with 30s of charge time \r\n"
"\t- Charge depletes whilst held  \r\n"
"\t- Minicrits apply to melee only"
msgstr ""
"- 들고 있는 동안 동료를 강화한다 \r\n"
"\t- 30초 분량 충전 포함 \r\n"
"\t- 들고 있으면 충전이 줄어든다  \r\n"
"\t- 미니 치명타는 근접 공격에만 적용"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:602
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "Special Gimmick Weapons"
msgstr "특수 기믹 무기"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:603
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid ""
"I've modified all of these weapons personally! They all have a SPECIAL "
"GIMMICK!"
msgstr "이 무기들은 전부 내가 직접 개조했지! 전부 특별한 기믹이 있어!"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:604
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid ""
"Duckhunter: A shotgun that ricochets constantly!\r\n"
"\tLever-Action: Fires much faster if you shoot right after it flips!\r\n"
"\tDolt Big Iron: A pistol that encourages you to shoot fast!\r\n"
"\tBuff Banner: A support weapon that provides mini-crits!\r\n"
"\tKukri: A knife that maims zombs, slowing them!"
msgstr ""
"덕헌터: 계속 튕기는 산탄총!\r\n"
"\t레버액션: 레버가 젖혀진 직후에 쏘면 훨씬 빨리 쏜다!\r\n"
"\t돌트 빅 아이언: 빨리 쏘게 만드는 권총!\r\n"
"\t버프 배너: 미니 치명타를 주는 지원 무기!\r\n"
"\t쿠크리: 좀비를 불구로 만들어 느리게 하는 칼!"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:616
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "You're out of food! The trader gives "
msgstr "식량이 다 떨어졌다! 상인은 "

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:616
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid " an old snubnose pistol as a consolation prize."
msgstr "에게 위로 선물로 낡은 단총신 권총을 준다."

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:618
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "Leave for now"
msgstr "일단 떠난다"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:620
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "Duckhunter for 30 food"
msgstr "덕헌터 - 식량 30"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:623
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "Lever-Action for 20 food"
msgstr "레버액션 - 식량 20"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:626
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "Dolt Big Iron for 20 food"
msgstr "돌트 빅 아이언 - 식량 20"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:629
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "Buff Banner for 6 food"
msgstr "버프 배너 - 식량 6"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:632
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "Kukri for 4 food"
msgstr "쿠크리 - 식량 4"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:656
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid ""
"was a professional pool player. He has turned this into his own warrior-"
"philosophy."
msgstr "은(는) 프로 당구 선수였다. 그는 이걸 자기만의 전사 철학으로 승화시켰다."

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:671
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid ""
"is an OLD WEST cowboy. Dual-wields firearms if they're in the top two slots!"
msgstr "은(는) 서부 시대 카우보이다. 위쪽 두 칸에 총이 있으면 쌍권총을 쓴다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:688
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "is a big game hunter. Aim for long distance headshot combos!"
msgstr "은(는) 맹수 사냥꾼이다. 장거리 헤드샷 콤보를 노려라!"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:705
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "You just have to think of the whole world as a pool table!"
msgstr "세상 전체를 당구대라고 생각하면 돼!"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:710
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "Professional Pool Player"
msgstr "프로 당구 선수"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:712
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid ""
"This man has the physicality and demeanor of a pro athlete. You instantly know, just from looking at him, that he plays darts or pool.\r\n"
"\tHe might POSSIBLY be into bowling, instead."
msgstr ""
"이 남자는 프로 운동선수 같은 체격과 태도를 지녔다. 보자마자 다트나 당구를 치는 사람이라는 걸 바로 알 수 있다.\r\n"
"\t어쩌면 볼링일 수도 있고."

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:714
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid ""
"This character gets stamina and power bonuses for hitting zombies at the "
"furthest tip of his melee range! He also has a 10% chance of getting "
"explosive results from his tip attacks!"
msgstr ""
"이 캐릭터는 근접 사거리 맨 끝으로 좀비를 맞히면 스태미나와 위력 보너스를 받는다! 끝부분 공격은 10% 확률로 폭발하기도 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:716
#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:742
#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:765
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "Leave him for now"
msgstr "일단 두고 간다"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:717
#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:743
#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:766
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "Hire him - 15 food"
msgstr "고용한다 - 식량 15"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:719
#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:745
#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:768
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "You need 15 food to recruit him to the party."
msgstr "동료로 영입하려면 식량 15가 필요하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:720
#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:746
#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:769
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "Can't spare the food"
msgstr "식량을 줄 여유가 없다"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:729
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid ""
"WHERE'D MY PISTOLS GO?\r\n"
"\tCONSARN IT!"
msgstr ""
"내 권총 어디 갔어?\r\n"
"\t제기랄!"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:735
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "HIGH NOON"
msgstr "하이 눈"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:737
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid ""
"This grizzled man is dressed up in a poncho and sombrero. He has two pistol "
"holsters at his sides. On closer inspection, his holsters are empty."
msgstr "이 꾀죄죄한 남자는 판초와 솜브레로 차림이다. 양옆에 권총집이 두 개 있다. 자세히 보니 권총집이 비어 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:738
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid ""
"WHAT TIME IS IT?\r\n"
"\tIT'S HIGH NOON."
msgstr ""
"지금 몇 시지?\r\n"
"\t하이 눈이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:740
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid ""
"Honcho the Gunslinger can dual wield firearms, if they have ammo! Just put "
"them in your top two slots, or just swap (or lock in the pause menu) until "
"he's holding both."
msgstr ""
"총잡이 혼초는 탄약만 있으면 쌍권총을 쓸 수 있다! 위쪽 두 칸에 총을 넣거나, 둘 다 들 때까지 교체(또는 일시 정지 메뉴에서 "
"고정)하면 된다."

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:755
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "The hunt is on!"
msgstr "사냥 시작이다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:760
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid "THE DEADLIEST GAME OF ALL"
msgstr "가장 위험한 게임"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:762
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid ""
"The man resting by this campfire has the appearance of an old-timey big game"
" hunter. Pith helmet, dapper hunting outfit, heavy rifle."
msgstr "이 모닥불 옆에서 쉬는 남자는 옛날식 맹수 사냥꾼처럼 생겼다. 탐험모, 말쑥한 사냥복, 묵직한 소총."

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:763
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid ""
"This character has a rifle can be manually aimed for zombie headshots! The "
"rifle gets more powerful as you land longer distance headshots. This gets "
"even stronger as you get headshot streaks, especially past 30 headshots!"
msgstr ""
"이 캐릭터는 소총을 직접 조준해 좀비 헤드샷을 노릴 수 있다! 더 먼 거리에서 헤드샷을 맞힐수록 소총이 강해진다. 헤드샷 연속 기록이 "
"쌓이면 더 강해지고, 30연속을 넘기면 특히 강해진다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:92
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "BEGONE, UNDEAD!"
msgstr "꺼져라, 언데드!"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:93
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "SUNDER THE FIEND."
msgstr "마귀를 베어라."

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "PERISH, CREATURE!"
msgstr "소멸하라, 괴물아!"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:95
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "FOR VENGEANCE!"
msgstr "복수를 위하여!"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "MY OATH. YOUR SOUL."
msgstr "나의 맹세. 너의 영혼."

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:97
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "SLAYYYY THE FIEND!"
msgstr "마귀를 처단하라아아!"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:98
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "VANQUISH THE UNDEAD!"
msgstr "언데드를 무찔러라!"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:99
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "BEGONE FROM THIS PLANE!"
msgstr "이 차원에서 꺼져라!"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:100
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "RADIANT AS THE DAWN!"
msgstr "새벽처럼 찬란하게!"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:101
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "SYCAMORE - KILL THIS MAN!"
msgstr "시카모어 - 이 남자를 죽여!"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:102
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "BEGONE, FOUL CRETIN!"
msgstr "꺼져라, 더러운 얼간이!"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:103
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "PERISH!"
msgstr "소멸하라!"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "BEGONE!"
msgstr "꺼져라!"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:105
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "NONE SHALL RESIST!"
msgstr "누구도 저항할 수 없다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:106
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "SILVER STEEL!"
msgstr "은빛 강철!"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:107
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "MY SILVER EDGE!"
msgstr "나의 은빛 칼날!"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "PERISH, WRETCHED ENTITY!"
msgstr "소멸하라, 비참한 존재여!"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "VANQUISHED!"
msgstr "처단했다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:116
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "WHY DO YOU FORSAKE ME SYCAMORE"
msgstr "어째서 날 버리는 거야, 시카모어"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:163
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "SMITTEN FOR:"
msgstr "강타:"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:197
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "accidentally smites the toilet every time she tries to flush it."
msgstr "은(는) 변기 물을 내리려 할 때마다 실수로 변기를 성스럽게 강타해 버린다."

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:306
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "Time grinds...even mountains to dust..."
msgstr "시간은 갈아 낸다... 산조차 먼지로..."

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:339
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid ""
"talks about you behind your back during Time Stop...especially if you make "
"Za Warudo jokes!"
msgstr "은(는) 시간 정지 중에 네 험담을 한다... 특히 네가 '자 와루도' 드립을 치면!"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:394
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "is the planeswalker, a defect; forever a lost broken soul."
msgstr "은(는) 차원 방랑자이자 결함품이다. 영원히 길 잃은 부서진 영혼이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:395
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "can simply phase through the car door to leave the car."
msgstr "은(는) 차 문을 그냥 통과해서 내릴 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:396
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "responds only in jumbled, incoherent sounds, as if through TV static."
msgstr "은(는) TV 잡음처럼 뒤죽박죽이고 알아들을 수 없는 소리로만 대답한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:397
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "is all that remains of somebody who time forgot."
msgstr "은(는) 시간에게 잊힌 누군가의 마지막 잔재다."

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:398
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "teleports behind you. Nothing personell, kid."
msgstr "은(는) 네 뒤로 순간이동한다. 개인적인 감정은 없어, 꼬마야."

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:399
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "doesn't know anything about the origin of the split down their face."
msgstr "은(는) 자기 얼굴을 가로지르는 균열이 어디서 왔는지 전혀 모른다."

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:464
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "h0me?..."
msgstr "집...?..."

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:524
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "appears to fade in and out of existence, as if at will."
msgstr "은(는) 마치 마음대로 존재했다 사라졌다 하는 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:536
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "H.P LOVECRAFT'S WIFE"
msgstr "H.P 러브크래프트의 아내"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:538
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid ""
" approaches some kind of eldritch entity clenching its wounds. When "
"beckoned, it momentarily splits into two, but does not respond."
msgstr "은(는) 상처를 움켜쥔 어떤 기괴한 존재에게 다가간다. 손짓하자 그것은 잠시 둘로 갈라지지만, 대답은 없다."

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:539
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tReughhh...*whine*...reuuughhh..."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t으어어...*낑낑*...으어어어..."

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:541
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tWhat a friendly looking face!"
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t참 친근하게 생긴 얼굴이다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:543
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tThis extraplanar creature can blink with the SWAP button every so often."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t이 이차원 생명체는 가끔 교체 버튼으로 순간이동할 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:545
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tThe creature locks eyes with them suddenly. It tilts its head, as if curious, almost."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t생명체가 갑자기 그들과 눈을 맞춘다. 거의 호기심이라도 생긴 듯 고개를 갸웃한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:547
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "Tentatively ask "
msgstr "조심스럽게: "

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:547
#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:565
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid " to join"
msgstr "에게 합류 요청"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:548
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "NOPE. NO. THANK YOU"
msgstr "싫어. 안 돼. 됐어요"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:552
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "ROLLING A NATURAL 20 IN EVERY STAT"
msgstr "모든 능력치 주사위 20 굴림"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:554
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid ""
" rushes up to the group, silver sword in hand. A blinding flash of yellow "
"light follows, as she brings her sword down upon a wandering zombie!"
msgstr "은(는) 은검을 든 채 일행에게 달려온다. 눈부신 노란빛이 번쩍이더니, 그녀가 떠도는 좀비에게 검을 내리친다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:559
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tOh, hello hun. Can I help you? I'm Isabelle. It's my job to protect people like you. Let me join, I can get you out of here."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t어머, 안녕 자기. 도와줄까? 난 이자벨이야. 너희 같은 사람들을 지키는 게 내 일이지. 나를 끼워 줘, 여기서 꺼내 줄게."

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:561
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tAt a first glance, it's impossible to tell whether she's merely a cosplayer or an actual paladin from the old world."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t얼핏 봐서는 그냥 코스플레이어인지 진짜 옛 세계의 성기사인지 구분이 안 된다."

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:563
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tIsabelle can smite enemies on melee hits for extra damage."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t이자벨은 근접 공격을 맞힐 때 강타로 추가 피해를 줄 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:565
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "Allow "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:566
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "Leave this phony behind"
msgstr "이 가짜는 두고 간다"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:570
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "A RACE AGAINST THE CLOCK...CLOCK(S)?"
msgstr "시간과의 경주... 시계(들)?"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:572
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid ""
"Time seems to slow to a halt. Sound grows dull. Color seems to unsaturate. Suddenly, out of nowhere, a stranger appears.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"시간이 느려지다 멈추는 것 같다. 소리가 먹먹해진다. 색이 바래는 것 같다. 갑자기, 난데없이 낯선 사람이 나타난다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:575
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid ""
" turns towards the group, pocketwatch in hand. A short time later, his "
"silhouette seems to do the same thing."
msgstr "은(는) 회중시계를 든 채 일행 쪽으로 돌아선다. 잠시 뒤, 그의 실루엣도 똑같이 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:576
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t...drat. I've must've set my machine wrong again...I'd better join you, or I'm toast. And you'd better let me, or else YOU'RE toast."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t...젠장. 기계 설정을 또 잘못했나 보군... 너희랑 같이 가는 게 좋겠어, 아니면 난 끝장이야. 그리고 날 받아 주는 게 좋을 거다, 안 그러면 너희가 끝장이니까."

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:578
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tThis must be some kind of traveller from the future! Or possibly just someone who COOL'D IT successfully."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t미래에서 온 여행자인가 보다! 아니면 그냥 진정하기에 성공한 사람이거나."

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:580
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tOnce per mission, Clock King can stop time itself."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t임무마다 한 번, 클락 킹은 시간 자체를 멈출 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:582
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "Let "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:582
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid " join"
msgstr "을(를) 합류시킨다"

#: deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df:583
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/RETINA.df"
msgid "GO BACK TO THE FUTURE NERD"
msgstr "미래로 돌아가, 이 찐따야"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:134
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "TRY TO KEEP UP~"
msgstr "따라와 봐~"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:135
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "WHAT'S WRONG?~"
msgstr "왜 그래?~"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:136
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "TOO FAST?~"
msgstr "너무 빨라?~"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:137
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "I'M OUTPACING YOU!~"
msgstr "내가 앞질렀네!~"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:138
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "TRY HARDER!~"
msgstr "더 열심히 해 봐!~"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:139
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "COME ON NOW~"
msgstr "자 어서~"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:140
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "HOLY SMOKES~"
msgstr "세상에~"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:141
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "DAMN I'M GOOD~"
msgstr "젠장 나 너무 잘해~"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:142
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "TRY AGAIN!~"
msgstr "다시 해 봐!~"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:143
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "TOO QUICK!~"
msgstr "너무 빨라!~"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:144
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "WATCH ME GO!~"
msgstr "내 움직임 봐!~"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:145
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "Oopsie!"
msgstr "어머나!"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:146
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "Hehe, woopsie!~"
msgstr "헤헤, 어머나!~"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:147
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "GOTTA BE FASTER THAN THAT!"
msgstr "그보다 빨라야지!"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:148
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "KEEP UP NOW!~"
msgstr "자 따라와!~"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:149
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "SMASH!~"
msgstr "스매시!~"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:150
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "BASH!~"
msgstr "배시!~"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:151
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "I'M SO GOOD~"
msgstr "나 너무 잘해~"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:152
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "YOU WISH YOU COULD BE SO FAST!~"
msgstr "이렇게 빠르면 좋겠지?!~"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:153
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "BAY-OH-NETTI!~"
msgstr "베이-오-네티!~"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:160
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "BAYONETTI...BAYO-DEAD-TTI..."
msgstr "베요네티... 베요-죽-네티..."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:203
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid ""
"would probably take off like a rocket if she kept clicking her heels "
"together."
msgstr "은(는) 구두 뒤꿈치를 계속 부딪치면 아마 로켓처럼 날아갈 거다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:242
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "PUNY MORTALS..."
msgstr "하찮은 필멸자들..."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:243
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "TRIBUTE ONTO ME!"
msgstr "내게 공물을 바쳐라!"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:244
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "I AM YOUR SUPERIOR"
msgstr "나는 너희보다 위대하다"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:245
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "BEHOLD, THE MIGHTY!"
msgstr "보아라, 위대한 자를!"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:246
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "BEHOLD, ZEUS!"
msgstr "보아라, 제우스를!"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:247
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "WAIT, YOU AREN'T MY WIFE"
msgstr "잠깐, 너 내 아내가 아니잖아"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:248
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "I AM YOUR DEITY! PAY RESPECT!"
msgstr "나는 너희의 신이다! 경배하라!"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:249
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "WANT TO DATE?"
msgstr "데이트할래?"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:250
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "PATHETIC."
msgstr "한심하군."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:251
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "DISAPPOINTING..."
msgstr "실망스럽군..."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:252
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "THIS IS YOUR 'EARTH'?"
msgstr "이게 너희의 '지구'인가?"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:253
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "MY CURRENT, YOUR VEINS"
msgstr "나의 전류, 너의 혈관"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:254
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "BEHOLD...ZEUS!"
msgstr "보아라... 제우스를!"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:255
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "MY POWER INCREASES!"
msgstr "나의 힘이 커진다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:256
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "AAHHH... A TRIBUTE."
msgstr "아아... 공물이군."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:257
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "WITNESS A DEITY'S POWER!"
msgstr "신의 권능을 목격하라!"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:258
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "YOUR PRAYER, ANSWERED"
msgstr "너의 기도에 응답했다"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:259
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "BY MY WHISKERS."
msgstr "내 수염에 걸고."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:260
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "THUNDEROUS APPLAUSE..."
msgstr "우레와 같은 박수..."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:261
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "THUNDER-STRUCK!"
msgstr "벼락 맞았다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:262
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "I TAKETH AWAY."
msgstr "내가 거두어 가노라."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:356
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "OHHHH, TRAGIC DAYYYY!"
msgstr "오오오, 비극의 날이여어어!"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:430
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid ""
"was banished to the USA after an unsightly incident involving a moose and "
"his wife."
msgstr "은(는) 무스와 자기 아내가 얽힌 볼썽사나운 사건 이후 미국으로 추방됐다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:468
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "BURY ME...IN A PLUGHOLE..."
msgstr "날 묻어 줘... 배수구에..."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:497
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "Ah, it's like being at sea again!"
msgstr "아, 다시 바다에 나온 것 같군!"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:550
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid ""
"wonders if that sinking feeling when looking in the mirror will ever fade."
msgstr "은(는) 거울을 볼 때마다 드는 가라앉는 기분이 언젠가 사라질지 궁금하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:583
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "All the world's a bathtub, and us merely the sailors."
msgstr "온 세상이 욕조이고, 우리는 그저 선원일 뿐."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:588
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "Commander Of The Seas And Your Bathtub"
msgstr "바다와 당신의 욕조의 사령관"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:590
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid ""
"At first, this uniformed person is just splashing about in a puddle. Whatever kind of ritual this is, she's having a great time.  \r\n"
"\tShe looks like an important member of some naval force, or possibly a very eccentric fisherwoman."
msgstr ""
"처음에 이 제복 차림의 사람은 그냥 물웅덩이에서 첨벙대고 있다. 무슨 의식인지 몰라도, 엄청 즐거워 보인다.  \r\n"
"\t어느 해군의 중요한 인물 같아 보인다. 아니면 아주 괴짜인 어부거나."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:592
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid ""
"This character can exchange food for gas supply drops. She's very powerful "
"in wet weather or environments."
msgstr "이 캐릭터는 식량을 기름 보급품 투하와 바꿀 수 있다. 비 오는 날씨나 젖은 환경에서 매우 강하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:594
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "Leave her for now"
msgstr "일단 두고 간다"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:595
#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:668
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "Hire her - 15 food"
msgstr "고용한다 - 식량 15"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:597
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "You need 15 food to recruit Admiral Raven to the party."
msgstr "레이븐 제독을 영입하려면 식량 15가 필요하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:598
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "No bathtub navy for you!"
msgstr "욕조 해군은 너희에게 과분해!"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:609
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid ""
"THIS TRIBUTE IS...SUFFICIENT. ALSO, TASTY. ARE THESE CHIPS LIGHTNING "
"FLAVOURED?"
msgstr "이 공물은... 충분하다. 그리고 맛있군. 이 과자 번개 맛인가?"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:610
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "Perhaps the group WILL make it to Canada, after all!"
msgstr "어쩌면 일행은 결국 캐나다에 도착할지도 모르겠다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:615
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid ""
"YOU, DEAR MORTAL. YOU, MORTAL WHO IS PUNY, TINY, PATHETIC, WEAK, IN YOUR "
"FRAIL FLESH FORM..."
msgstr "너, 필멸자여. 너, 하찮고, 조그맣고, 한심하고, 나약한, 연약한 육신을 지닌 필멸자여..."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:617
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "Would ask ME - ME? - ZEUS OF MOUNT OLYMPUS...TO COOL IT?"
msgstr "감히 나에게 - 나에게? - 올림포스산의 제우스에게... 진정하라고?"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:618
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid ""
"In retrospect, this was a popping-a-tire-on-the-freeway level bad idea. With"
" a flick of his fingers, Zeus turns "
msgstr "돌이켜 보면, 고속도로에서 타이어 터지는 수준의 나쁜 생각이었다. 제우스가 손가락을 튕기자, "

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:618
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "'s organs into pure ZP. Nothing remains."
msgstr "의 장기가 순수한 ZP로 변한다. 아무것도 남지 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:619
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "Zeus, at least, looks pleased with himself."
msgstr "적어도 제우스는 자기한테 만족한 표정이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:626
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "TRUE SIGHT"
msgstr "진실의 눈"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:628
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid ""
"It's literally Zeus. The DINK. The myth. The legend. Here and now, right in "
"front of you, wandering Earth in human form!"
msgstr "말 그대로 제우스다. 그 얼간이. 그 신화. 그 전설. 바로 지금, 바로 눈앞에, 인간의 모습으로 지상을 떠돌고 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:629
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "MORTALS...WHAT TRIBUTE DO YOU HAVE FOR YOUR SUPERIOR?"
msgstr "필멸자들이여... 너희의 윗분께 어떤 공물을 바치겠느냐?"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:630
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "Thunder quakes between his words in the far distance."
msgstr "그의 말 사이사이로 먼 곳에서 천둥이 울린다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:630
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "...it could also just be a chips packet opening."
msgstr "...그냥 과자 봉지 뜯는 소리일 수도 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:631
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid ""
"This character wields lightning with great effectiveness, but it must be "
"charged through melee attacks."
msgstr "이 캐릭터는 번개를 아주 효과적으로 다루지만, 근접 공격으로 충전해야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:633
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "Leave him for now"
msgstr "일단 두고 간다"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:634
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "Hire him - 25 food"
msgstr "고용한다 - 식량 25"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:637
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "You need 25 food to recruit him to the party."
msgstr "동료로 영입하려면 식량 25가 필요하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:638
#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:671
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "Can't spare the food"
msgstr "식량을 줄 여유가 없다"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:641
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid " tells Zeus to 'Cool It'"
msgstr "이(가) 제우스에게 '진정해'라고 한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:654
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "YESYESYESYESYES! THIS'LL BE BLOODY BRILLIANT! ;3"
msgstr "좋아좋아좋아좋아좋아! 완전 끝내주겠다! ;3"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:660
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "SURVIVORS OF THE VAMPIRIC VARIETY"
msgstr "뱀파이어 계열 생존자"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:662
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid ""
"This woman won't stop talking. It's a relentless self-confident assault on "
"the senses. Nevertheless, she seems to be hauling a variety of good weapons,"
" as well as two pistols."
msgstr ""
"이 여자는 말을 멈추지 않는다. 자신감 넘치는 말이 감각을 끊임없이 공격한다. 그래도 좋은 무기 여러 개와 권총 두 자루를 끌고 다니는 "
"것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:663
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid ""
"OOH OOH HIRE ME! HIRE ME! I'LL BE SO FAST YOU WON'T BE ABLE TO KEEP UP, "
"DARLING~"
msgstr "우우 나 고용해! 나 고용해! 너무 빨라서 따라오지도 못할걸, 자기~"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:664
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "I'm sitting in this cyoa and even I already think she's annoying."
msgstr "이 선택지를 쓰고 있는 나조차 벌써 그녀가 짜증 난다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:665
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid ""
"This character has a combo system. When killing with your locked-slot "
"weapon, you'll roll a new weapon afterwards."
msgstr "이 캐릭터는 콤보 시스템이 있다. 고정 칸 무기로 처치하면 다음 무기가 무작위로 바뀐다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:667
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "Spare your ears"
msgstr "귀를 아낀다"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:670
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "You need 15 food to recruit her to the party."
msgstr "그녀를 영입하려면 식량 15가 필요하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:696
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "is trapped in this dimension as punishment for the roomgen system."
msgstr "은(는) 룸젠 시스템에 대한 벌로 이 차원에 갇혀 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:719
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid ""
"is mostly here on accident after 'quit-to-title' stopped working for her."
msgstr "은(는) '타이틀로 나가기'가 작동을 멈추는 바람에 거의 실수로 여기 와 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:737
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "i lost?"
msgstr "나 졌어?"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:785
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid ""
"will also steal your partner, children and house if unattended. A thief "
"through and through!"
msgstr "은(는) 방치하면 네 애인, 아이, 집까지 훔쳐 간다. 뼛속까지 도둑이다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:793
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "NYEHEHEHEHEH"
msgstr "녜헤헤헤헤헤"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:794
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "Nyheheheheh"
msgstr "녜헤헤헤헤"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:795
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "hehehehehh"
msgstr "헤헤헤헤헤"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:796
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "HEHEHEHEH"
msgstr "헤헤헤헤헤"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:797
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "HEY LEWIS"
msgstr "어이 루이스"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:798
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "hey lewis"
msgstr "어이 루이스"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:799
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "NYEHEHEH HEHEHEH"
msgstr "녜헤헤헤 헤헤헤"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:800
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "nyehehehehh"
msgstr "녜헤헤헤헤"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:801
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "I am...ELECTRIC MAN"
msgstr "나는... 일렉트릭 맨"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:802
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "pewter...the zombies are here."
msgstr "퓨터... 좀비들이 왔어."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:803
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "this is worse than the time when..."
msgstr "이건 그때보다 더 심하네..."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:804
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "SHUT UP MEG."
msgstr "닥쳐 멕."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:805
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "INSERT CUTAWAY GAG"
msgstr "컷어웨이 개그 삽입"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:806
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "at least I'm not drinking."
msgstr "적어도 술은 안 마시잖아."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:807
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "I just wanna talk to him."
msgstr "그냥 그 녀석이랑 얘기하고 싶을 뿐이야."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:808
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "Buttscratcher."
msgstr "엉덩이 긁개."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:809
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "Life is a terrible thing!"
msgstr "인생은 끔찍한 거야!"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:810
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "IT INSISTS UPON ITSELF."
msgstr "그건 스스로를 강요해."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:811
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "OOOH! A DOLLAR."
msgstr "오오! 1달러다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:824
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "hey, hey "
msgstr "야, 야 "

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:826
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "hey "
msgstr "야 "

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:834
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "*gasp*...aaaaaah...*gasp*...ahhhh..."
msgstr "*헉*...아아아아...*헉*...아아..."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:879
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid ""
"is wondering where all those good old-fashioned values have gone. Nyehehehe."
msgstr "은(는) 그 좋았던 옛 가치들이 다 어디로 갔는지 궁금하다. 녜헤헤헤."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:913
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "continuously whispers that"
msgstr "은(는) 계속 속삭인다:"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:913
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid " THE EVIL PLANT MUST PAY."
msgstr " 사악한 식물은 대가를 치러야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:921
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid ""
"WELL, IT WOULD TAKE YOU A FEW THOUSAND YEARS TO LEARN WHAT I HAVE LEARNED..."
msgstr "글쎄, 내가 배운 걸 배우려면 너희는 몇천 년은 걸릴 거다..."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:922
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "ok, no need to be a dink about it."
msgstr "그래, 그렇게까지 재수 없게 굴 필요는 없잖아."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:924
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid ""
"HMM...I DID BUY THESE HEALING ITEMS FOR THE UPCOMING BATTLE. THEY WON'T BE "
"OF MUCH USE TO ME NOW. YOU CAN HAVE THEM INSTEAD."
msgstr "흠... 다가올 전투를 위해 이 회복 아이템을 사 뒀는데. 이제 나한텐 별 쓸모가 없겠군. 대신 너희가 가져라."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:925
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "Magus gives the group 2 healing sprays!"
msgstr "마구스가 일행에게 치료 스프레이 2개를 준다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:926
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid ""
"Afterwards, he performs a circular hand motion. A ritual circle appears at "
"his feet. In a second, he vanishes into thin air! Magical."
msgstr "그러고는 손으로 원을 그린다. 그의 발밑에 의식의 원이 나타난다. 순식간에 그는 허공으로 사라진다! 마법이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:932
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "DOGS OF THE APIARY 2...WAIT, NO"
msgstr "양봉장의 개들 2... 아니, 잠깐"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:934
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid ""
"When the group exits their car for a break, heavenly music plays. White "
"flashes in their eyes. In front of them, some sort of green-goblin looking "
"magic thing materialises."
msgstr ""
"일행이 쉬려고 차에서 내리자, 천상의 음악이 흐른다. 눈앞에 하얀 빛이 번쩍인다. 그들 앞에 초록 고블린처럼 생긴 마법적인 무언가가 "
"나타난다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:935
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid " looks around, confused, glancing at his hands and then back towards "
msgstr "은(는) 당황한 채 주위를 둘러보고, 자기 손을 내려다봤다가 다시 "

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:935
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid ". He has some kind of staff."
msgstr "을(를) 바라본다. 그는 지팡이 같은 걸 들고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:936
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "SOOOOO, THAT WAS DEATH. INTER-EST-ING. Oh, hello friends!"
msgstr "그러니까아아, 그게 죽음이었군. 흥-미-롭-군. 아, 안녕 친구들!"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:937
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "It's not everyday somebody on the road respawns in front of you."
msgstr "길에서 누가 눈앞에 리스폰하는 일은 흔치 않다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:938
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "Magus can copy other weapons for himself and also can use magic."
msgstr "마구스는 다른 무기를 복사해 쓸 수 있고 마법도 쓸 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:939
#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:940
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "Ask "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

