#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:967
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "There's a large man with cartoon-like glasses ahead."
msgstr "앞에 만화 같은 안경을 쓴 덩치 큰 남자가 있다."

