msgid " legendary quest"
msgstr " 전설적인 여정"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:1063
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid " and win."
msgstr "을(를) 마치고 이기려면 힘을 더 모아야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:1064
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "Pick an upgrade for him:"
msgstr "그를 위한 업그레이드를 고르세요:"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:1074
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid ""
" accepts a spare ace of hearts card. As it transitions into his hand, it "
"suddenly becomes "
msgstr "은(는) 남는 하트 에이스 카드를 받는다. 카드가 손에 들어가자 갑자기 "

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:1074
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "steel-like"
msgstr "강철처럼"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:1074
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid " and a "
msgstr " 단단해지고, "

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:1074
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "red seal"
msgstr "붉은 인장"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:1074
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid " appears out of nowhere."
msgstr "이 난데없이 나타난다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:1075
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "As soon as "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:1075
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid " puts the card on the table, the plant pot explodes!"
msgstr "이(가) 카드를 테이블에 내려놓자마자, 화분이 폭발한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:1076
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid ""
"YOU'RE A REAL JOKER! THANKS. I'LL FOLLOW YOU, AT LEAST TO THE END OF THIS "
"ANTE."
msgstr "너 진짜 조커구나! 고마워. 따라갈게, 적어도 이번 앤티가 끝날 때까지는."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:1090
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "COLD STAKE CANADIAN DECK"
msgstr "콜드 스테이크 캐나다 덱"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:1092
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "The group is walking through a park when they come across a jester."
msgstr "일행이 공원을 지나다가 광대를 만난다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:1093
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid ""
" seems to be deep into some kind of insane poker game. Across from him sits "
"a plant in a pot."
msgstr "은(는) 미친 포커 게임에 푹 빠져 있는 것 같다. 맞은편엔 화분에 심긴 식물이 앉아 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:1094
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "THE EVIL PLANT MUST PAY. THE EVIL PLANT MUST PAY."
msgstr "사악한 식물은 대가를 치러야 한다. 사악한 식물은 대가를 치러야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:1095
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid ""
"Somehow, despite playing against an inanimate object, he seems to be losing."
msgstr "어째선지, 무생물과 게임을 하면서도 지고 있는 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:1097
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "Bribe him with a card"
msgstr "카드로 매수한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:1098
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid "Leave him behind"
msgstr "두고 간다"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "How much more betrayal can I take?"
msgstr "얼마나 더 배신당해야 하지?"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "How bout that dink's face?"
msgstr "저 얼간이 얼굴 좀 봐라?"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "I'm the kingpin."
msgstr "내가 두목이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "Never had the makings of a varsity athlete."
msgstr "대표 선수감은 아니었지."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "20 years in a sardine can."
msgstr "정어리 통조림에서 20년."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:24
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "Zombies don't buy drink."
msgstr "좀비는 술을 안 사."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "Capped."
msgstr "끝냈다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:26
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "Capiche?"
msgstr "알아들어?"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "Ya understand me?"
msgstr "내 말 알아듣겠어?"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "You come to me...on the day of my 4th kidney stone..."
msgstr "내 네 번째 신장 결석 날에... 날 찾아오다니..."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:29
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "It won't be cinematic."
msgstr "영화처럼 멋지진 않을 거다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:30
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "Just do as you're told."
msgstr "시키는 대로나 해."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:31
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "No knees? Just compromise."
msgstr "무릎이 없다고? 그럼 타협해."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "Family is everything. Mine are zombies."
msgstr "가족이 전부야. 내 가족은 좀비지만."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "Heyyyyyy how ya doinnnn?"
msgstr "헤이이이이 잘 지내에에?"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "This is the schmutz."
msgstr "이건 쓰레기야."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "Where's the gabagool?"
msgstr "카피콜라는 어딨어?"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "20 Gs on my desk by sundown."
msgstr "해 질 때까지 내 책상에 2만 달러."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "Get 'em boys!"
msgstr "쳐라, 얘들아!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "You better watch yourself!"
msgstr "몸조심하는 게 좋을 거다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "You got-a bee on-a your hat!"
msgstr "모자-에 벌-이 있다고!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "2x!"
msgstr "2배!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:75
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "You can't kill me...I'm made!"
msgstr "날 죽일 순 없어... 난 조직원이라고!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:91
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
"did 20 years in the can eating gabagool off the grilled cheese radiator."
msgstr "은(는) 감방에서 20년 동안 그릴드 치즈 라디에이터 위의 카피콜라를 먹으며 지냈다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:121
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "isn't even being paid anymore, he just loves his job."
msgstr "은(는) 이제 월급도 못 받지만, 그냥 자기 일을 사랑한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:154
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " has modified the engine for even greater efficiency."
msgstr "은(는) 엔진을 개조해 효율을 더 높였다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:155
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " tinkered with the timing of the pistons."
msgstr "은(는) 피스톤 타이밍을 손봤다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:156
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " fiddled with the air-fuel mixture."
msgstr "은(는) 공기-연료 혼합비를 조절했다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:157
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " replaced an outdated part in the engine."
msgstr "은(는) 엔진의 낡은 부품을 교체했다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:158
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " is trying out a leaner fuel formula."
msgstr "은(는) 더 희박한 연료 배합을 시험 중이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:159
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " is driving the car with ludicrous speed."
msgstr "은(는) 터무니없는 속도로 차를 몰고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:160
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " is driving like a maniac."
msgstr "은(는) 미치광이처럼 운전하고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:161
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " has his foot almost surgically attached to the accelerator."
msgstr "은(는) 발이 거의 수술로 가속 페달에 붙어 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:183
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "Car MPG improved!"
msgstr "차 연비 향상!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:184
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "Car speed increased!"
msgstr "차 속도 증가!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:197
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
"is a person we know only two things about: he's good at driving, and he's "
"called The Stug."
msgstr "은(는) 우리가 딱 두 가지만 아는 사람이다: 운전을 잘하고, 이름이 스터그라는 것."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:213
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "WAAAAHOOHOOHOOOO"
msgstr "와아아아후후후우우"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:214
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "YEEEHOOOOOOO"
msgstr "이이이호오오오오오"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:215
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "AAYYYYHOOOOOO"
msgstr "아아이이이호오오오오"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:216
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "HOOOHOOOO HOOOOOHHH"
msgstr "호오오호오오 호오오오오"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:217
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "I CAN SEE MY HOUSE!"
msgstr "우리 집이 보인다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:218
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "AAAAAAAAAAAA"
msgstr "아아아아아아아아아아아아"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:219
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "AAAaaaaaaAAAAAAHHHH"
msgstr "아아아아아아아아아아아악"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:220
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "GAHHHHHHHHHHH"
msgstr "크아아아아아아아악"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:221
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "THAT HURT! YOU MOTHER-"
msgstr "아프잖아! 이 개자-"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:222
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "YEEEEHHAWWWWWW"
msgstr "이이이이햐아아아"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:269
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "I'M GONNA CRASH OUT!"
msgstr "나 박살 난다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:284
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
"is very insecure about his intelligence after being called 'dummy' his whole"
" life."
msgstr "은(는) 평생 '더미'라고 불린 탓에 자기 지능에 대해 자격지심이 심하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:315
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " has fixed up some old scrap into a workable weapon!"
msgstr "은(는) 낡은 고철을 손봐서 쓸 만한 무기로 만들었다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:316
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " has produced another firearm!"
msgstr "은(는) 총을 또 하나 만들어 냈다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:317
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " crafted up a gun for the team!"
msgstr "은(는) 일행을 위해 총을 만들었다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:318
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " has completed their latest gun project!"
msgstr "은(는) 최신 총기 프로젝트를 완성했다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:319
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " didn't blow up while working on their new gun!"
msgstr "은(는) 새 총을 만들다가 폭발하지 않았다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:320
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " repaired an old firearm for the team!"
msgstr "은(는) 일행을 위해 낡은 총을 수리했다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:325
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " is still working hard on his latest project."
msgstr "은(는) 여전히 최신 프로젝트에 열심이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:326
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " needs more time to finish his firearms project."
msgstr "은(는) 총기 프로젝트를 끝내려면 시간이 더 필요하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:327
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " works industrously to repair an old firearm."
msgstr "은(는) 낡은 총을 고치려고 부지런히 일한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:328
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " is tinkering with an old gun in his spare time."
msgstr "은(는) 남는 시간에 낡은 총을 만지작거리고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:329
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " has a repair side-project going on again."
msgstr "은(는) 또 수리 부업을 벌이고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:330
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " is exercising his mechanical skills in the downtime."
msgstr "은(는) 쉬는 시간에 기계 실력을 갈고닦는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:353
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " forges some ammo for the trip."
msgstr "은(는) 여정을 위해 탄약을 만든다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:369
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "has the designs for the first eye-phone rolling around his head."
msgstr "은(는) 최초의 아이폰 설계도를 머릿속에 굴리고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:406
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "bury me...in an inflatable pool..."
msgstr "날 묻어 줘... 비닐 풀장에..."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:414
#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:1039
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "READY "
msgstr "준비 "

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:532
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "likes to play shot-put...with an entire anchor. For fun."
msgstr "은(는) 닻을 통째로 들고 포환던지기를 한다. 재미로."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:575
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "is passionate about their ever growing collection of daggers."
msgstr "은(는) 계속 늘어나는 단검 컬렉션에 열정적이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:601
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
"The group is full.\r\n"
"\t\t\tWho would you like to replace to make room for "
msgstr ""
"일행이 꽉 찼다.\r\n"
"\t\t\t이 사람 자리를 만들려면 누구를 뺄까: "

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:606
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " accepts "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:606
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " to the team!"
msgstr "을(를) 일행으로 받아들인다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:612
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "THE ARENA OF THE ONE"
msgstr "단 하나의 경기장"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:614
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
" fights the First Mate successfully! As per naval tradition, she is legally "
"obligated to offer her position as part of the team."
msgstr "은(는) 일등 항해사와 싸워 이긴다! 해군 전통에 따라, 그녀는 법적으로 일행 자리에 합류를 제안해야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:615
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "THAT THERE WAS A PROPER SCUFFLE! YOU'AR AN ALRIGHT FELLA."
msgstr "그거 제대로 된 한판이었다! 너 꽤 괜찮은 녀석이구먼."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:618
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "Let her go"
msgstr "보내 준다"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:619
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "Recruit her"
msgstr "영입한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:621
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " fights the First Mate! "
msgstr "은(는) 일등 항해사와 싸운다! "

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:621
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " punches them up easily."
msgstr "은(는) 일행을 가볍게 두들겨 팬다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:623
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
"PFFFTTT, YOU CALL THAT FIGHT? I'VE SEEN PEOPLE WITHOUT ARMS FIGHT BETTER!"
msgstr "푸흐흐, 그걸 싸움이라고 해? 팔 없는 사람들도 그보단 잘 싸우겠다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:624
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "How incredibly rude."
msgstr "엄청 무례하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:631
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "PUT 'ER IN A LONGBOAT TIL SHE'S SOBER"
msgstr "술 깰 때까지 보트에 처박아 둬"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:633
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
"Along the road, there's a woman with a big anchor. She leaps up high, and "
"drops it cartoon-style on a zombie."
msgstr "길가에 커다란 닻을 든 여자가 있다. 그녀는 높이 뛰어올라 만화처럼 좀비 위에 닻을 떨어뜨린다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:634
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
"HEY YOU THERE! WANNA FIGHT? IF YOU WIN, I'LL JOIN. IF YOU DON'T - UH, DON'T "
"WORRY ABOUT THAT ACTUALLY."
msgstr "어이 거기! 한판 붙을래? 너희가 이기면 합류할게. 지면 - 어, 사실 그건 신경 쓰지 마."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:635
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "An interesting proposal. "
msgstr "흥미로운 제안이다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:635
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " looks strong, but stupid."
msgstr "은(는) 강해 보이지만, 멍청해 보인다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:636
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
"First Mate can leap into the air with the SWAP button! Hit zombies on the "
"way back down for devastating effect."
msgstr "일등 항해사는 교체 버튼으로 공중에 뛰어오를 수 있다! 내려오면서 좀비를 맞히면 파괴적인 효과가 난다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:638
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "Fight "
msgstr "대결: "

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:639
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "Ignore her"
msgstr "무시한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:643
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "THE ONE WHO CALLS THE SHOTS"
msgstr "명령을 내리는 자"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:645
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
"When the group is searching through a town, there's a man sitting in a cafe "
"window."
msgstr "일행이 마을을 뒤지는데, 카페 창가에 한 남자가 앉아 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:646
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "AY. AY YOU. YOU LOOK LIKE YOU KNOW HOW TO HANDLE YOURSELF."
msgstr "어이. 어이 너. 너 좀 할 줄 아는 놈 같은데."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:647
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
"He's dressed like a criminal boss. Or maybe he's just a really intimidating "
"businessman? What could possibly go wrong!"
msgstr "범죄 조직 보스 같은 차림이다. 아니면 그냥 아주 위압적인 사업가일지도? 뭐 잘못될 게 있겠어!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:648
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
"This character can multishot with firearms! Some special weapons excluded."
msgstr "이 캐릭터는 총으로 멀티샷을 쏠 수 있다! 일부 특수 무기는 제외."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:651
#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:664
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "Ask "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:651
#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:664
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " to join"
msgstr "에게 합류 요청"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:652
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "Say NO to rackets"
msgstr "조폭은 거절한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:656
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "A LAST STAND"
msgstr "최후의 저항"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:658
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "Ahead, there's man in a steel breastplate and helmet."
msgstr "앞에 강철 흉갑과 투구를 쓴 남자가 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:659
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
"Skillfully, he knocks down two zombies with his halberd, and executes them "
"cleanly in a single swing."
msgstr "그는 능숙하게 할버드로 좀비 둘을 쓰러뜨리고, 단 한 번 휘둘러 깔끔하게 처형한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:660
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
"Hallo-ha! Zis is a fine day for the end of the world, no? You look like you "
"can take care of yourself."
msgstr "할로-하! 세상 끝나기 좋은 날이군, 안 그래? 자네들은 스스로를 지킬 줄 아는 것 같군."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:661
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "This character has a special combo to knock down and execute zombies."
msgstr "이 캐릭터는 좀비를 쓰러뜨리고 처형하는 특수 콤보가 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:665
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "Leave the medieval era"
msgstr "중세 시대는 두고 간다"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:669
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "TONIGHT..."
msgstr "오늘 밤..."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:669
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " MIGHT RECRUIT SOMEBODY"
msgstr "은(는) 누군가를 영입할지도 모른다"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:671
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "In a rusted, burnt out car there's a man in a full white driving suit."
msgstr "녹슬고 불탄 차 안에 하얀 레이싱 슈트를 입은 남자가 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:672
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
"Even though the steering wheel is long gone, he's still pretending to use "
"it."
msgstr "핸들은 진작 없어졌는데도, 그는 여전히 운전하는 척하고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:673
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "Perhaps you could convince him to join with your real, actual car."
msgstr "진짜, 실제 차가 있으니 그를 합류하게 설득할 수 있을지도."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:674
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "This character can significantly improve your car over time."
msgstr "이 캐릭터는 시간이 지나면서 차를 크게 개선할 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:677
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "Tempt "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:677
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " to drive your car"
msgstr "에게 차를 몰게 꼬드긴다"
